#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1331 expect=violation domain=MH
#note "*** RISKY CALL (IsoDateComparison forall-hull grounding) ***. Row 1: month-partial MHSTDTC=2020-07 vs complete MHDTC=2020-06-30 -> lower bound 2020-07-01 > 2020-06-30 -> fires. Row 2: year-partial MHSTDTC=2020 -> lower bound 2020-01-01 not > 2020-06-30 -> clean. Row 3: MHSTDTC empty -> clean."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 MHSTDTC=2020-07
dataset MH class=EVENTS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col MHSEQ    type=Num
col MHTERM   type=Char
col MHSTDTC  type=Char
col MHDTC    type=Char
---
S1 | MH | 001 | 1 | ASTHMA  | 2020-07 | 2020-06-30
S1 | MH | 001 | 2 | ECZEMA  | 2020    | 2020-06-30
S1 | MH | 001 | 3 | GOUT    |         | 2020-06-30
